[SIZE=5][B]Support policy, please read before reporting[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][B]Custom setups get limited to no support.[/B] That means root modules, Xposed/LSPosed, custom kernels, or apps from APKMirror and similar sites that don't match this build (Google system apps especially). Before you report, reproduce the problem on a clean install without them.
[*][B]No logs, no report.[/B] Bug reports without a logcat are flagged for deletion. Capture one right after the problem happens:
[CODE]adb logcat -b all -d > log.txt[/CODE]
Then post it with your build date, your carrier and the steps to reproduce.
[/LIST]

